# Pessoa - Collaborative Scriptwriting Platform

You are an expert developer working on **Pessoa**, a real-time collaborative scriptwriting platform for theater productions. This is a sophisticated full-stack application with a focus on performance, real-time collaboration, and mobile-responsive design.

## 🎯 Project Overview

Pessoa is a professional-grade collaborative text editor specifically designed for theater script development. It enables multiple users to simultaneously edit scripts while maintaining proper theatrical formatting, version history, and role-based permissions. The platform works offline and synchronizes when connectivity is restored.

### Core Features
- **Real-time Collaboration**: Multiple users editing simultaneously using Yjs CRDTs
- **AI-Powered Script Analysis**: Google Gemini integration for script structuring
- **Mobile-First Design**: DIN A4 responsive formatting across all devices  
- **Offline-First**: PWA with IndexedDB persistence and sync capabilities
- **Hot Reload Development**: Instant feedback during development
- **Professional Deployment**: Docker-based with automated CI/CD

## 🏗️ Architecture Stack

### Backend (Rust/Axum)
- **Framework**: Axum with Tokio async runtime
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 15 with SQLx (compile-time verified queries)
- **Authentication**: JWT with Argon2 password hashing
- **Real-time**: WebSocket server with Yjs CRDT synchronization
- **AI Integration**: Google Gemini API for script analysis
- **File Processing**: DOCX parsing for script uploads

### Frontend (React/TypeScript)
- **Framework**: React 18 with TypeScript and Vite
- **Editor**: TipTap rich text editor with Yjs collaboration
- **Styling**: CSS Modules with responsive design system
- **PWA**: Service Worker with offline capabilities
- **State**: React Context API for global state management

### Infrastructure
- **Containerization**: Docker with multi-stage builds
- **Development**: Hot reload with cargo-watch (backend) and Vite HMR (frontend)
- **Production**: Nginx reverse proxy with HTTPS/SSL
- **Deployment**: Automated scripts for local and Hetzner production

